{
  "name": "script-executor",
  "displayName": "Script Executor",
  "description": "快速执行自定义脚本命令，支持参数化脚本、内置NPM/Git命令",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "publisher": "CylAlon",
  "author": "CylAlon",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/CylAlon/script-runner"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/CylAlon/script-runner/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "script",
    "executor",
    "terminal",
    "npm",
    "git",
    "command",
    "shell",
    "task",
    "runner",
    "automation"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.80.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "script-executor.openMenu",
        "title": "打开脚本执行器",
        "icon": "$(terminal-bash)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "script-executor.openMenu",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Script Executor",
      "properties": {
        "scriptExecutor.scripts": {
          "type": "array",
          "default": [],
          "description": "自定义脚本列表",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "label": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "脚本的显示名称（可包含图标，如 $(terminal) 脚本名）"
              },
              "description": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "脚本的描述信息"
              },
              "command": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "要执行的命令，支持参数占位符如 {port} {env}"
              },
              "params": {
                "type": "array",
                "description": "命令参数定义，用于在执行前让用户选择参数值",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "参数名称，对应命令中的占位符 {name}"
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "参数的显示标签"
                    },
                    "options": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "参数的可选值列表",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "label": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "选项的显示标签"
                          },
                          "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "选项的实际值"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": ["label", "value"]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "required": ["name", "label", "options"]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "label",
              "command"
            ]
          },
          "markdownDescription": "配置自定义脚本列表。\n\n**基础示例**：在 settings.json 中添加：\n```json\n\"scriptExecutor.scripts\": [\n  {\n    \"label\": \"$(terminal) 构建项目\",\n    \"description\": \"运行项目构建\",\n    \"command\": \"npm run build\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**带参数示例**：在 .vscode/scripts.json 中添加：\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"$(rocket) 启动服务\",\n      \"description\": \"启动开发服务器\",\n      \"command\": \"npm run dev -- --port {port} --mode {mode}\",\n      \"params\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"port\",\n          \"label\": \"端口号\",\n          \"options\": [\n            { \"label\": \"3000\", \"value\": \"3000\" },\n            { \"label\": \"8080\", \"value\": \"8080\" }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"mode\",\n          \"label\": \"运行模式\",\n          \"options\": [\n            { \"label\": \"开发\", \"value\": \"development\" },\n            { \"label\": \"生产\", \"value\": \"production\" }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
        },
        "scriptExecutor.enableBuiltinScripts": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "是否启用内置的常用命令（npm 和 git 操作）"
        },
        "scriptExecutor.terminalReuseStrategy": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["smart", "always", "never"],
          "default": "smart",
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "智能检测：如果终端正在运行交互式程序（如 claude-cli），则创建新终端；否则复用现有终端",
            "总是复用：始终使用同一个终端执行命令",
            "从不复用：每次执行命令都创建新终端"
          ],
          "description": "终端复用策略"
        },
        "scriptExecutor.terminalIdleTimeout": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 10,
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 300,
          "description": "终端空闲超时时间（秒）。在智能检测模式下，如果距离上次命令执行超过此时间，将创建新终端以避免干扰可能的交互式程序。设为 0 表示始终复用同一终端。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile",
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./",
    "pretest": "npm run compile && npm run lint",
    "lint": "eslint src --ext ts"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.x",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.80.0",
    "@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin": "^6.4.1",
    "@typescript-eslint/parser": "^6.4.1",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^3.6.2",
    "eslint": "^8.47.0",
    "typescript": "^5.1.6"
  }
}
